cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use VLAQuantBench, please cite the paper below.
title: "VLAQuantBench: Closed-Loop Evaluation of Post-Training Quantization for Vision-Language-Action Models"
abstract: >-
  A controlled benchmark that evaluates post-training quantization of
  vision-language-action policies by closed-loop task success under each
  benchmark's official protocol, across four models, four simulation families,
  seven bit settings, and quantization scopes from end-to-end down to single
  layers.
